  Mutations                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                     
  delete_users, insert_users, update_users — Hasura-generated CRUD; no auth checks visible.                                            
   
  N+1 Risk Map                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                     
  ┌─────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┬───────────┐                               
  │            Resolver             │        Upstream method        │      Mitigation      │  Status   │
  ├─────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼───────────┤                               
  │ Launch.rocket                   │ api.getRocket                 │ In-request Map cache │ Mitigated │                             
  ├─────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼───────────┤                             
  │ Launch.ships                    │ api.getShip per ship          │ None                 │ Known N+1 │                               
  ├─────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼───────────┤                               
  │ LaunchRocketFirstStageCore.core │ api.getCore per core          │ None                 │ Known N+1 │                               
  ├─────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼───────────┤                               
  │ History.flight                  │ api.queryNextLaunch per event │ None                 │ Known N+1 │                               
  └─────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┴───────────┘                               
                                                                                                                                     
  Parse-Layer Risk Areas (src/parse-service.ts)                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                     
  ┌───────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────┐   
  │     Function      │                   REST key → GraphQL key                    │                     Risk                     │ 
  ├───────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤   
  │ parseShip         │ ship_id→id, ship_name→name, ship_model→model,               │ Silently returns undefined if REST key       │ 
  │                   │ ship_type→type                                              │ renamed                                      │
  ├───────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤   
  │ parseLaunchpad    │ full_name→name, drops padid                                 │ Mutation of pad object in-place is fragile   │   
  ├───────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤   
  │ parseMissions     │ mission_id→id, mission_name→name                            │ Same rename risk                             │   
  ├───────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────┤ 
  │ Launch.links      │ article→article_link, webcast→video_link,                   │ Deeply nested object access — null at any    │   
  │ (inline)          │ flickr.original→flickr_images, reddit.*→reddit_*            │ level crashes without optional chaining      │ 
  └───────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────┘   
                                                                                                                                     
  Authorization Surface

  None. No @auth directives, no role checks, no token validation in any resolver. The only security layer is depth/complexity limiting 
  in validationRules.ts. This is documented as a gap below.
                                                                                                                                       
  ---                                                                                                                                  
  Step 2 — Agentic Architecture Proposal
                                                                                                                                       
  flowchart TD                                                                                                                       
      subgraph L1["Layer 1 · AI Test Generator"]
          SDL["schema.graphql\n(source of truth)"]                                                                                     
          GEN["Stub Generator\n(SDL → Jest files)"]                                                                                    
          HAPPY["Happy-path variants"]                                                                                                 
          EDGE["Edge-case variants\n(null, [], pagination)"]                                                                           
          SDL --> GEN --> HAPPY & EDGE --> OUT["src/__tests__/generated/*.test.ts"]                                                    
      end                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                     
      subgraph L2["Layer 2 · Self-Healing Engine"]                                                                                     
          FAIL["Test failure"] --> CLASS["Failure Classifier\n(6 categories)"]                                                       
          CLASS -->|schema_drift| PATCH["Auto-patch snapshot\nopen PR via gh cli"]                                                     
          CLASS -->|resolver_bug| RPT["HEALING_REPORT.md"]                                                                             
          CLASS -->|upstream_change| RPT                                                                                               
          CLASS -->|parse_layer| RPT                                                                                                   
          CLASS -->|performance| RPT                                                                                                   
      end                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                     
      subgraph L3["Layer 3 · Cloud Sandbox Executor"]                                                                                  
          SRV["In-memory ApolloServer\n+ addMocksToSchema"]                                                                          
          ISO["Per-entity isolated context"]                                                                                           
          JSON["qa-failure-report.json"]                                                                                               
          SRV --> ISO --> JSON                                                                                                         
      end                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                     
      OUT --> SRV
      JSON --> CLASS
      JSON --> CI                                                                                                                      
   
      subgraph CI["GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/autonomous-qe.yml)"]                                                              
          J1["1 · Schema Lint\n(every push)"]                                                                                        
          J2["2 · Contract + Diff\n(every push)"]                                                                                      
          J3["3 · Null Handling\n(every push)"]                                                                                      
          J4["4 · N+1 Gate\n(PRs only)"]                                                                                               
          J5["5 · Autonomous QA\n(every push, artifact upload on main)"]                                                             
          J6["6 · Auth Audit\n(weekly Monday cron)"]                                                                                   
          J7["7 · Self-Healing PR Bot\n(main failure only)"]                                                                           
          J1 --> J2 & J3 & J4                                                                                                          
          J2 & J3 --> J5                                                                                                               
          J5 -->|failure on main| J7                                                                                                   
      end                                                                                                                              
   
  ---                                                                                                                                  
  Step 3 — Test Templates (written to src/__tests__/generated/)                                                                      
                                                                                                                                       
  contract.snapshot.test.ts
                                                                                                                                       
  - Full SDL toMatchSnapshot() gate                                                                                                    
  - Field-presence table for all 11 entity id fields
  - Parse-layer rename guards: asserts schema exposes article_link not article, video_link not webcast, etc.                           
  - Deprecated-query retention guard (mission, missions, missionsResult)                                                               
                                                                                                                                       
  nplusone.proxy.test.ts                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                       
  - makeCallCounterProxy() — transparent Proxy that increments counts[methodName] on every call                                        
  - Budget=1: Launch.rocket memoization (in-request Map) — asserts getRocket called exactly once for 3 launches sharing the same ID
  - Budget=distinct: Two different rocket IDs → 2 calls                                                                                
  - Known N+1 documented: Launch.ships (budget=3), History.flight (budget=2), LaunchRocketFirstStageCore.core (budget=2)             
                                                                                                                                       
  null.handling.test.ts                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                       
  - 5 empty-list scenarios (ships, launches, histories, dragons, rockets)                                                              
  - 4 null single-entity scenarios (ship, launch, company, roadster)
  - 3 null nested-object scenarios (Launch.links, Launch.ships, Launch.rocket)                                                         
  - 4 pagination edge cases (limit=0, offset>total, limit>size)                                                                        
  - 3 parse-service null-input guards (weight nulls, kg-only derivation, null item in array filtered)                                  
                                                                                                                                       
  failure.report.test.ts                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                       
  - Runs the full runAutonomousQA cycle against addMocksToSchema                                                                       
  - categorizeFailure() maps each CoverageFailure → { category, file, diagnosis, suggestedFix }
  - Writes qa-failure-report.json and HEALING_REPORT.md to cwd()                                                                       
  - Asserts report structure, category enum, zero non-performance failures                                                             
                                                                                                                                       
  ---                                                                                                                                  
  Step 4 — CI/CD Pipeline (.github/workflows/autonomous-qe.yml)                                                                        
                                                                                                                                     
  ┌─────────────────────┬────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │         Job         │        Trigger         │                     Hard-fail condition                      │                      
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Schema Lint         │ Every push             │ graphql-schema-linter rule violation                         │                      
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤                    
  │ Contract + Diff     │ Every push             │ Breaking change vs origin/main; snapshot mismatch            │                      
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤                      
  │ Null Handling       │ Every push             │ Any null-handling test failure                               │                      
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤                      
  │ N+1 Gate            │ PRs only               │ Call count exceeds documented budget                         │                    
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤                      
  │ Autonomous QA       │ Every push             │ HIGH-severity anomaly; report artifact uploaded on main      │
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤                      
  │ Auth Audit          │ Weekly (Mon 08:00 UTC) │ Advisory only; uploads auth-audit-report.json                │                    
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤                      
  │ Self-Healing PR Bot │ main failure           │ Opens PR with regenerated snapshots + HEALING_REPORT.md body │                    
  └─────────────────────┴────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘                      
                                                                                                                                     
  ---                                                                                                                                  
  Step 5 — Remaining Gaps (requires human implementation)                                                                            
                                                                                                                                       
  ┌───────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │          Gap          │                                             What's needed                                              │   
  ├───────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤ 
  │ Actual AI model for   │ Job 7 runs --updateSnapshot mechanically. True healing (e.g., inferring the correct field mapping from │
  │ self-healing          │  a schema diff) requires an LLM call — integrate via @anthropic-ai/sdk in a custom script              │
  ├───────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤   
  │ DataLoader for ships  │ Launch.ships is a documented N+1. The proxy test will catch any fix; the DataLoader itself is not in   │
  │                       │ scope here                                                                                             │   
  ├───────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤ 
  │ Auth layer            │ No auth exists. The weekly audit identifies sensitive fields (twitter, etc.) but there is nothing to   │   
  │                       │ protect against. If auth is added, annotate resolvers with @auth and extend validationRules.ts         │   
  ├───────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Cloud sandbox         │ Job 5 runs in the GitHub Actions runner. True isolation per entity (separate VMs/containers) requires  │   
  │ provisioning          │ Kubernetes or AWS Batch — not modelled here                                                            │   
  ├───────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Real upstream API     │ The QA cycle mocks everything. A nightly run against the live api.spacexdata.com would catch upstream  │   
  │ contract              │ drift before it reaches production                                                                     │   
  ├───────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ PR label creation     │ autonomous-qe and schema-drift labels must be created in the GitHub repo settings before Job 7's gh pr │   
  │                       │  create --label call succeeds                                                                          │   
  └───────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                                   